#!/bin/sh
# Managed by Cinc (homelab_ayatori)
# 导出 k0s PKI 与各身份客户端证书的到期时间，供 node_exporter textfile collector 采集。
# k0s 重启时轮换 PKI 中的服务端证书；客户端证书由 client-credentials 自行续签（ADR-0021），过期说明续签失败。
set -eu
out=<%= @textfile_dir %>/ayatori_certificates.prom
tmp="$out.tmp"
not_after() { date -d "$(openssl x509 -noout -enddate | cut -d= -f2)" +%s; }
{
  echo '# HELP ayatori_certificate_not_after_timestamp_seconds 证书到期时间。'
  echo '# TYPE ayatori_certificate_not_after_timestamp_seconds gauge'
  for f in /var/lib/k0s/pki/*.crt /var/lib/k0s/pki/etcd/*.crt; do
    echo "ayatori_certificate_not_after_timestamp_seconds{source=\"k0s-pki\",path=\"$f\"} $(not_after < "$f")"
  done
  for c in <%= @identities_dir %>/*/client.pem; do
    [ -e "$c" ] || continue
    identity=$(basename "$(dirname "$c")")
    echo "ayatori_certificate_not_after_timestamp_seconds{source=\"kubeconfig\",identity=\"$identity\"} $(not_after < "$c")"
  done
  # 部署方自签的服务证书（ayatori-api），converge 在到期前 45 天重签。
  for c in <%= @identities_dir %>/*-serving/tls.crt; do
    [ -e "$c" ] || continue
    name=$(basename "$(dirname "$c")")
    echo "ayatori_certificate_not_after_timestamp_seconds{source=\"serving\",identity=\"${name%-serving}\"} $(not_after < "$c")"
  done
} > "$tmp"
chmod 0644 "$tmp"
mv "$tmp" "$out"
